    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d627">

                <pb facs="0799" n="705" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg705"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lee to Mr.
                            Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-19"><hi rendition="#italic">August 19,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Charles Govin landed from the <hi rendition="#italic">Three Friends</hi> July 6;
                    joined insurgents; captured in a skirmish on the 9th with Arturo Adrian and
                    Adolfo Mijares. They were bound and taken off. Nothing heard of them since. They
                    are not in the fort nor prisoners.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
